{"ref":"BDB, עָבַר²","hw":"עָבַר²","html":"† <big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">עָבַר</span>]</big>  <strong>vb. denom. </strong><br><strong>Hithp.</strong>  <strong> be arrogant, infuriate oneself</strong>;—Pf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִתְעַבָּ֑ר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:62\" href=\"/Psalms.78.62\">ψ 78:62</a>; 2 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">הִתְעַבַּ֫רְתָּ</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:39\" href=\"/Psalms.89.39\">89:39</a>; Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּתְעַבֵּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.26\">Dt 3:26</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּתְעַבָּ֑ר</span> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:21\" href=\"/Psalms.78.21\">ψ 78:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:59\" href=\"/Psalms.78.59\">59</a>; Pt. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִתְעַבֵּר</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.16\">Pr 14:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.17\">26:17</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">מִתְעַבְּרוֹ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.2\">20:2</a>;— <strong>1.</strong>  <em>be arrogant</em>, <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 14:16\" href=\"/Proverbs.14.16\">Pr 14:16</a> (opp. <span dir=\"rtl\">יָרֵא</span>). <strong>2.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  <em>put oneself in a fury, become furious</em>. c. <span dir=\"rtl\">בְּ</span> pers. <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 3:26\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.3.26\">Dt 3:26</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:62\" href=\"/Psalms.78.62\">ψ 78:62</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">עִם</span> pers. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 89:39\" href=\"/Psalms.89.39\">89:39</a>; abs. <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:21\" href=\"/Psalms.78.21\">78:21</a>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 78:59\" href=\"/Psalms.78.59\">59</a> (all of God); of man, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַל</span> rei. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 26:17\" href=\"/Proverbs.26.17\">Pr 26:17</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <em>incite</em> one <em>to fury for oneself</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 20:2\" href=\"/Proverbs.20.2\">Pr 20:2</a> (si vera l.; cf. De Ges<sup>§ 54 f.</sup>).","next":"BDB, עֲבָרִים","prev":"BDB, עֶבְרָה"}